+# Import people: each line name,grade,terms,contact (the last two may be absent or blank) adds a person, in order. Every line is
+# checked first by the person form's rules (and no name or contact repeated within the paste); one failing line refuses the whole
+# import, which writes nothing, not even an audit line. Each is added as the form adds them. Responds with how many were added.
